Runtime-only storage for user-uploaded car-body panel images.

The backend creates this directory when necessary and stores verified JPEG or
PNG content under generated UUID filenames. Uploaded images are ignored by Git
and must not be treated as training data unless they are separately reviewed,
labelled, consented for that use, and added through the dataset preparation
workflow.

For the university PoC, clear this runtime directory according to the approved
local data-retention policy. Never commit user uploads or personal information.
